* MV209 legacy LTspice diode model, attributed to Motorola in the source line.
* Copied from cmp\standard.dio in a local LTspice Libraries folder, line 217.
* Original model authorship and revision have not been independently verified.
* The onsemi MV209 datasheet identifies the physical diode but does not supply this SPICE line.
.model MV209_LEGACY D(Is=.43p Rs=1 Bv=35 Ibv=10u Isr=4.4p Cjo=125p Vj=.75 M=.908)
